            "latex": "\\text{Question: Write a Pythagorean triple whose smallest member is } 8."
        },
        {
            "step_id": "s2",
            "latex": "\\text{Answer: We can get Pythagorean triples using the general form } 2m, m^2 - 1, m^2 + 1."
        },
        {
            "step_id": "s3",
            "latex": "\\text{Let us first take}"
        },
        {
            "step_id": "s4",
            "latex": "m^2 - 1 = 8"
        },
        {
            "step_id": "s5",
            "latex": "\\text{So},"
        },
        {
            "step_id": "s6",
            "latex": "m^2 = 8 + 1 = 9"
        },
        {
            "step_id": "s7",
            "latex": "\\text{which gives}"
        },
        {
            "step_id": "s8",
            "latex": "m = 3"
        },
        {
            "step_id": "s9",
            "latex": "\\text{Then},"
        },
        {
            "step_id": "s10",
            "latex": "2m = 6 \\text{ and } m^2 + 1 = 10"
        },
        {
            "step_id": "s11",
            "latex": "\\text{The triplet B thus } 6, 8, 10. \\text{ But } 8 \\text{ is not the smallest member in this. So, let us try}"
        },
        {
            "step_id": "s12",
            "latex": "2m = 8"
        },
        {
            "step_id": "s13",
            "latex": "\\text{then}"
        },
        {
            "step_id": "s14",
            "latex": "m = 4"
        },
        {
            "step_id": "s15",
            "latex": "\\text{we get}"
        },
        {
            "step_id": "s16",
            "latex": "m^2 - 1 = 16 - 1 = 15"
        },
        {
            "step_id": "s17",
            "latex": "\\text{and}"
        },
        {
            "step_id": "s18",
            "latex": "m^2 + 1 = 16 + 1 = 17"
        },
        {
            "step_id": "s19",
            "latex": "\\text{The triplet B is } 8, 15, 17 \\text{ with } 8 \\text{ as the smallest member. Note that the number } 8 \\text{ is a power of } 2, \\text{ specifically } 2^3 = 8. \\text{ Also it is also a composite number.}"
        }
    ],
